<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23751" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειπν-ίζω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					62
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐδείπνισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					4.5.5
				</span></i>
			 (v. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> infr. cit.):—<i>entertain at dinner,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέπεφνεν δειπνίσσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.535
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δειπνίζοντες Ξέρξεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.118
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν πόλιν ὅλην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).1346
				</span></i>
			: also c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τινὰ δεῖπνον</span>
			<i>give</i> one a dinner, <i><span class="en">
				Matro
				<u>Conv.</u>
				2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοὰς δεδειπνισμένων
			θεάτρων</span> the applause of spectators <i>bribed by dinners,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.92e
			</span></i>.</div>
